-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

    CAEN FE Library

    Install procedure on Linux.

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------


Prerequisites
-------------

- A compiler supporting C99 or C11/C17.
  The following compiler versions have been tested on x86_64:
  - GCC >= 7 (up to version 14)
  - clang >= 5 (up to version 20)


Install
-------

In the extracted folder run

    $ ./configure --disable-assert
    $ make
    $ sudo make install
    $ sudo ldconfig
